#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:-1
msgid "The CSV file format as exported by Krita."
msgstr "Súborový formát CSV ako exportovaný z Krita."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:10
msgid "*.csv"
msgstr "\\*.csv"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:10
msgid "CSV"
msgstr "CSV"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:10
msgid "Comma Separated Values"
msgstr ""
"*.csv|Hodnoty oddelené čiarkou\n"
"*|Všetky súbory"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:15
msgid "\\*.csv"
msgstr "\\*.csv"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:17
msgid ""
"``.csv`` is the abbreviation for Comma Separated Values. It is an open, "
"plain text spreadsheet format. Since the CSV format is a plain text itself, "
"it is possible to use a spreadsheet program or even a text editor to edit "
"the ``*.csv`` file."
msgstr ""
"``.csv`` je skratka pre Comma Separated Values (hodnoty oddelené čiarkou). "
"Je to otvorený formát tabuľkového procesora v čistom texte. Keďže formát CSV "
"je sám osebe čistý text, je možné na úpravu súboru ``*.csv`` použiť "
"tabuľkový procesor alebo dokonca textový editor."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:19
msgid ""
"Krita supports the CSV version used by TVPaint, to transfer layered "
"animation between these two software and probably with others, like Blender. "
"This is not an image sequence format, so use the document loading and saving "
"functions in Krita instead of the :guilabel:`Import animation frames` and :"
"guilabel:`Render Animation` menu items."
msgstr ""
"Krita podporuje verziu CSV používanú programom TVPaint na prenos animácií s "
"vrstvami medzi týmito dvoma programami a pravdepodobne aj s inými, ako je "
"Blender. Toto nie je formát sekvencie obrázkov, preto namiesto položiek "
"ponuky :guilabel:`Importovať snímky animácie` a :guilabel:`Vykresliť "
"animáciu` použite funkcie načítania a ukladania dokumentu v Krite."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:21
msgid ""
"The format consists of a text file with ``.csv`` extension, together with a "
"folder under the same name and a ``.frames`` extension. The CSV file and the "
"folder must be on the same path location. The text file contains the "
"parameters for the scene, like the field resolution and frame rate, and also "
"contains the exposure sheet for the layers. The folder contains :ref:"
"`file_png` picture files. Unlike image sequences, a key frame instance is "
"only a single file and the exposure sheet links it to one or more frames on "
"the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Formát pozostáva z textového súboru s príponou ``.csv`` spolu so zložkou "
"rovnakého názvu s príponou ``.frames``. Súbor CSV a zložka musia byť na "
"rovnakom mieste v ceste. Textový súbor obsahuje parametre scény, ako je "
"rozlíšenie poľa a snímková frekvencia, a tiež obsahuje expozičný list pre "
"vrstvy. Zložka obsahuje obrázkové súbory :ref:`file_png`. Na rozdiel od "
"sekvencií obrázkov je inštancia kľúčového snímku len jeden súbor a expozičný "
"list ho prepojí s jedným alebo viacerými snímkami na časovej osi."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:26
msgid ".. image:: /images/Csv_spreadsheet.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/Csv_spreadsheet.png"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:26
msgid "A ``.csv`` file as a spreadsheet in :program:`LibreOffice Calc`."
msgstr "Súbor ``.csv`` ako tabuľka v programe :program:`LibreOffice Calc`."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:28
msgid ""
"Krita can both export and import this format. It is recommended to use 8bit "
"sRGB color space because that's the only color space for :program:`TVPaint`. "
"Layer groups and layer masks are also not supported."
msgstr ""
"Krita môže tento formát exportovať aj importovať. Odporúča sa použiť 8-"
"bitový farebný priestor sRGB, pretože to je jediný farebný priestor pre "
"program :program:`TVPaint`. Skupiny vrstiev a masky vrstiev tiež nie sú "
"podporované."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:30
msgid ""
"TVPaint can only export this format by itself. In :program:`TVPaint 11`, use "
"the :guilabel:`Export to...` option of the :guilabel:`File` menu, and on the "
"upcoming :guilabel:`Export footage` window, use the :guilabel:`Clip: Layers "
"structure` tab."
msgstr ""
"TVPaint môže tento formát iba exportovať. V programe :program:`TVPaint 11` "
"použite voľbu :guilabel:`Exportovať do...` z ponuky :guilabel:`Súbor` a v "
"zobrazenom okne :guilabel:`Exportovať záber` použite kartu :guilabel:`Klip: "
"Štruktúra vrstiev`."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:35
msgid ".. image:: /images/Csv_tvp_csvexport.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/Csv_tvp_csvexport.png"

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:35
msgid "Exporting into ``.csv`` in TVPaint."
msgstr "Export do formátu ``.csv`` v programe TVPaint."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_csv.rst:37
msgid ""
"To import this format back into TVPaint there is a George language script "
"extension. See the \"Packs, Plugins, Third party\" section on the TVPaint "
"community forum for more details and also if you need support for other "
"software. Moho/Anime Studio and Blender also have plugins to import this "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Na spätný import tohto formátu do TVPaintu existuje rozšírenie skriptu v "
"jazyku George. Ďalšie podrobnosti nájdete v časti \"Balíčky, zásuvné moduly, "
"tretie strany\" na komunitnom fóre TVPaint, a tiež ak potrebujete podporu "
"pre iný softvér. Moho/Anime Studio a Blender majú tiež zásuvné moduly na "
"import tohto formátu."

